          "quote": "For VASP optimization, we use the standard projector augmented wave (PAW-PBE) potentials and generalized gradient approximation (GGA) for exchange–correlation potential. The following input parameters are used: kinetic energy cutoff of 500 eV , electronic convergence at 1.0 × 10−5 eV , and force convergence at−1.0 × 10−3 eV/Å and 1 k point at Γ in the reciprocal cell.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
